<title>UK: P&amp;O, Kuoni set up Asian travel joint venture.</title>
<headline>P&amp;O, Kuoni set up Asian travel joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Peninsular and Oriental Steam Navigation Co and Swiss travel group Kuoni Reisen AG on Thursday said they had formed a joint venture to exploit the fast growing Asian travel market.</p>
<p>The joint venture will be based on the existing business of P&amp;O Travel Ltd (Hong Kong) in which Kuoni today purchased a 50 percent stake for 5.7 million stg.</p>
<p>P&amp;O Travel Ltd, based in Hong Kong with operations in Singapore and Bangkok, will continue to trade under its present name for now.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
